Subject: [PATCH 127/155] [ae-patch] Manage shared Claude accounts from
 Settings' Claude accounts list

Settings > Claude accounts gains a Shared group: every shared account with its id and who added it, selectable for new chats by everyone. An admin (the server's /v1/me answer) also gets Rename and Remove per row, Remove asking once, and + Add, which opens a form for the name, an optional label and the setup-token OAuth token. The token field is a password input cleared on submit. The server checks admin on every change.
